---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import profile from '../assets/profile.jpg';
import SocialLinks from '../components/SocialLinks.astro';
---

<Base title="About Me" description="About Chittapriya Mondal — technology leader in autonomous agent architecture, AI and cloud platforms.">
  <article class="container page">
    <h1>About Me</h1>
    <div class="links"><SocialLinks /></div>
    <div class="prose">
      <Image src={profile} alt="Chittapriya Mondal" width={600} class="photo" />

      <p>
        I am Chittapriya Mondal, a technology leader with expertise in Autonomous Agent Architecture, Microservices,
        Event‑Driven Systems, IoT/IIoT, Cloud Platforms (Azure &amp; AWS), Big Data, AI/ML, SaaS, and Open‑Source
        Technologies. My core specialization lies in designing and scaling enterprise‑grade autonomous agent ecosystems
        that enable intelligent automation, operational resilience, and transformative digital outcomes.
      </p>
      <p>
        I am recognized for combining strategic architectural vision with the ability to dive deep into complex systems,
        troubleshoot at the code and infrastructure level, and deliver hands‑on technical execution when it matters most.
        My leadership approach blends system thinking, platform engineering discipline, and customer‑centric product
        strategy to build solutions that are robust, scalable, and future‑ready.
      </p>
      <p>
        I actively practice SAFe® for Lean Enterprises 5.0 and Scrum/Kanban, driving cross‑functional alignment,
        iterative delivery, and engineering excellence across distributed teams. My focus is on building high‑impact
        platforms, mentoring engineering and product teams, and accelerating innovation across enterprise, industrial,
        and cloud‑native domains.
      </p>
      <p>
        At the intersection of architecture, AI, and product strategy, I am passionate about shaping next‑generation
        intelligent systems that elevate business performance and unlock new possibilities for digital transformation.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .page { max-width: 820px; padding-top: 3rem; }
  h1 { font-size: 2.4rem; line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .links { margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .prose :global(.photo) {
    float: right;
    width: 280px;
    max-width: 40%;
    margin: 0 0 1rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    cursor: default;
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .prose :global(.photo) { float: none; max-width: 60%; margin: 0 auto 1.5rem; }
  }
</style>
